./AGENTS.md:13:4. **Privacy by default**: no analytics/tracking beyond a privacy-respecting page view; local-first storage where the brief allows; no third-party fonts/scripts loaded from CDNs (self-host).
./AGENTS.md:20:- Commit small, often, with clear messages. Never commit secrets. Never touch infra, DNS, or billing from this repo — the factory does deployment.
./AGENTS.md:21:- Paid features integrate only through the Sociobot billing API (`https://api.sociobot.in/api/v1/...`, Dodo-backed); never embed a payment provider directly.
